    "source_floor": "Each source floor is the convex plate-outline mesh extruded from physical hole-body z=-2mm to z=0; it is not a box primitive.",
    "goal_relation": "Task-frame center is offset +target_center_z from the physical hole body; public per-point success z=-target_center_z is therefore the floor top.",
    "nominal_square_plate_mapping": "The task calls public mjfit with bottom_thickness=0.002. Its floor remains the generator convex mesh, attached to the existing plate body. For the nominal square plate it is cuboid-equivalent: z lies from -t/2-2mm to -t/2, whose top is target_bottom_z. No custom primitive Box or XML floor is constructed, and no equivalence to all 64 full-range floor outlines is claimed."
  },
